<h1>About Platform Donations</h1>

<p>
    Platform Donations is a non-profit service designed to facilitate recurrent donations for creators and projects in Russia.
</p>

<h2>Our Mission</h2>
<p>
    Similar to platforms like Liberapay, we aim to provide a stable crowdfunded support system for creators who contribute
    to the commons - whether through free software, open knowledge, or other valuable community contributions.
</p>

<h2>Payment Methods</h2>
<p>We support the following Russia-specific payment methods:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Mir Cards</strong> - Russia's national payment system</li>
    <li><strong>YooMoney</strong> - Popular Russian e-wallet</li>
    <li><strong>QIWI</strong> - Widely-used payment service</li>
    <li><strong>WebMoney</strong> - Established online payment system</li>
    <li><strong>Bank Transfers</strong> - Direct bank-to-bank transfers</li>
</ul>

<h2>Recurrent Donations</h2>
<p>
    Our platform enables you to set up automatic recurring donations on a weekly, monthly, or yearly basis,
    ensuring consistent support for the creators and projects you care about.
</p>

<h2>Transparency</h2>
<p>
    As a non-profit service, we are committed to transparency in our operations. All donations go directly to
    the intended recipients, with clear records of all transactions.
</p>

<p>
    <a href="/Donations/Create">Start supporting creators today!</a>
</p>
